infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Parent chain: where to apply the fix
  desc One dominant parent means fix the caller; many thin parents means fix the leaf
  compares
    - label Concentrated fan-in — one dominant parent
      children
        - label Fix the caller
          desc Call less often, batch, cache, or eliminate the call
        - label json.Marshal from one logger
          desc The logger is the bug — do not switch JSON library
        - label Localised fix
          desc Hot under a single entry-point only
    - label Distributed fan-in — many thin parents
      children
        - label Fix the leaf itself
          desc Shared infra: fixing one caller leaves nineteen unchanged
        - label json.Marshal from twenty handlers
          desc JSON is the bottleneck — switch library or pre-encode
        - label Amplified fix
          desc A 30% gain on a shared leaf compounds on every path
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f59e0b
